@startuml tool3-privacy-shield
title Tool 3 - Privacy shield (PII proxy)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #6A1B9A

rectangle "YOUR AGENT\n--\n'Email Rahul,\nPAN ABCDE1234F'" as A #F3E5F5
rectangle "PRIVACY SHIELD\n--\nswaps real data\nfor fake placeholders\n(and back again)" as P #E1BEE7
cloud "ChatGPT / Claude\n--\nsees only\n'<NAME_1>, <PAN_2>'" as L #F3E5F5

A -down->  P : "1. real personal data goes in"
P -down->  L : "2. only safe placeholders leave"
L -up->  P : "3. reply comes back"
P -up->  A : "4. real values put back in"

note right of P
  Works for Indian IDs (Aadhaar, PAN, UPI, GSTIN)
  and names/addresses in English, Hindi, Hinglish.
  The outside AI never sees the real data.
end note
@enduml
